// carried here: `grep -rn '"OreLifted"' Source/`. A trailing // path:line on
// every row makes clang-format align a hundred and fifteen comments into a
// column whose position depends on the longest line in the block, so adding one
// long event name reformats the whole table and the diff stops being readable.
